### 1. Webhook deliveries that failed their first try — newest first
POST http://localhost:8080/api/webhook-deliveries/filter
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "page": 0,
  "size": 20,
  "status": "FAILED",
  "source": "POST_CALL",
  "from": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### 2. Send a FAILED delivery once more
POST http://localhost:8080/api/webhook-deliveries/1/resend
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
